[h2]Build 0.9.27[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Conveyor arms now have [b]Rotate source[/b] and [b]Rotate destination[/b] buttons instead of rotate clockwise / counter-clockwise. The gripper (source) and the output tray (destination) turn separately, so an arm can pass things straight across or round a corner - perpendicular moves between two belts, or from a belt into a hopper beside it. The arm swings between whichever two sides you pick, and its tray shows where it puts things down.
[*]Existing arms keep putting down straight across from their gripper until you turn the destination.
[/list]
